        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. If the inclusion of a new class in the bargaining unit is agreed to by the parties or found appropriate by PERB but the University's determination of the pay rate is questioned by the Union, the Union shall, within 15 calendar days of the inclusion determination, request in writing that the University meet to discuss the pay rate for the class. If such a request is made, the parties shall meet within 30 calendar days of the request.",
            "block_bbox": [
                182,
                97,
                1122,
                265
